## Loading in MS4 Me

Place both files in your MS4 Me project's `/ses/` directory, then open `{{system_name}}.ses` in the SES editor. Right-click and choose **Prune SES to PES** to reopen the pruning flow from the included `.pes`, or **Run PES file in SimViewer** to simulate directly.

